    {
      "id": "impersonal-se",
      "targets": [
        "impersonal se"
      ],
      "title": "When nobody in particular does it",
      "explanation": "Se plus the he/she form says what people do in general: ¿Cómo se dice…? Aquí se habla español.",
      "examples": [
